#: index.in:296
msgid ""
"Depends on what you mean by \"<strong>centralized package repository</"
"strong>\", if you mean a repository that stores them all like Debian-based "
"distributions do with DEB packages, no, there are thousands of packages, and "
"they are usually distributed to remote sites and difficult to find.</em></"
"p>\n"
"  <p><em>If instead you mean an AUR-style repo with scripts that easily find "
"all AppImages, <strong>you're in the right place!</strong>"
msgstr ""
"Depende de lo que entiendas por \"<strong>repositorio centralizado de "
"paquetes</strong>\": si te refieres a un repositorio que los almacene todos, "
"como hacen las distribuciones basadas en Debian con los paquetes DEB, no; "
"hay miles de paquetes, que suelen estar repartidos por sitios remotos y son "
"difíciles de encontrar.</em></p>\n"
"  <p><em>Si, en cambio, te refieres a un repositorio al estilo de AUR con "
"scripts que encuentran fácilmente todos los AppImage, <strong>¡estás en el "
"lugar adecuado!</strong>"

